      "notes": [
        {
          "category": "description",
          "text": "Java ZooKeeper doesn't partition disks; C libfdisk1 not called at runtime. This statement concerns SUSE-SU-2026:2485-1 in pkg:rpm/suse/libfdisk1 as a subcomponent of pkg:oci/zookeeper?repository_url=index.docker.io/suse-observability/zookeeper. It does not assert the status of pkg:rpm/suse/libfdisk1 when used independently or in other products."
        },
        {
          "category": "description",
          "text": "Apache ZooKeeper (Java) does not link against libmount1; mount library not in JVM execute path. This statement concerns SUSE-SU-2026:2485-1 in pkg:rpm/suse/libmount1 as a subcomponent of pkg:oci/zookeeper?repository_url=index.docker.io/suse-observability/zookeeper. It does not assert the status of pkg:rpm/suse/libmount1 when used independently or in other products."
        },
        {
          "category": "description",
          "text": "Apache ZooKeeper (Java) uses java.util.UUID; libuuid1 C library not linked by JVM. This statement concerns SUSE-SU-2026:2485-1 in pkg:rpm/suse/libuuid1 as a subcomponent of pkg:oci/zookeeper?repository_url=index.docker.io/suse-observability/zookeeper. It does not assert the status of pkg:rpm/suse/libuuid1 when used independently or in other products."
        }
      ],
